WEBVTT

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.020
Oh, that feels good!

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.430
What a turn of events, am I right?

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.440
After all that talk
about saving the world...

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.780
Who would believe I'd end up working
for the Demon Lord's Army?

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.570
So weird...

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.780
So this is the secret Devil's Hot Spring!

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:58.040
Looks like a relaxing spot
despite its name!

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.330
Very good, very good!

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.750
Bath!

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:15.640
I told you to wash up first!

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:18.850
I'm willing to overlook
most of your personality faults,

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:18.850
Boo. Boring.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:21.640
but irresponsible public bathing
I will not condone!

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.060
Don't you agree, Ranga?

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:28.480
Th-That...

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.150
Wow! I mean, nasty!

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:35.200
What are you talking about?
You have one just like this.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.370
No, no, no, no, not like this!

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.630
I feel threatened...

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:48.580
Whatever.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.210
Bath! Bath time!

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.550
I've managed to get promoted
from deputy assistant section chief

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.680
and director of the business
development division

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.310
to the Demon Lord Army's
Western Invasion Force Director.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.060
Ninomiya, you're weird
but really impressive.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.940
But it's still not enough.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:10.980
I have to meet the Demon Lord himself in
order to find out how to go back to Japan.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.360
You have to attend a board meeting
to see the Demon Lord, right?

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.320
Yeah.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:20.040
I will remove all of the high-ranking
members who might get in the way!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.950
Nobody can stop my meteoric rise!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.920
Since...

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.580
I am me!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.300
Hey! Don't stand up so suddenly!

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.510
So this is General Ninomiya.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.850
I heard he was introduced to the
Demon Lord's Army through General Ant...

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.930
Like I always say, the kids
these days have no respect!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.350
It's not all about getting results!

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:51.900
You'll never make it unless you
harbor a deep respect for all things!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.950
Gramps, just the other day you
were yelling at your subordinate,

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:59.280
saying there's no value in
their lives if they don't get results.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.790
What was that about? Are you senile?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.950
Silence!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.460
I won't take that kind of talk from you;
all you ever do is slap your men around!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.170
Stop spitting everywhere!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:19.840
I can almost feel my IQ dropping just
listening to your emotional outbursts.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.850
That said, staring
at your large breasts...

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.140
...makes a certain part
of me rise up instead.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.150
You're gross, you dumb virgin!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.360
I-I-I'm not a virgin!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:39.660
Stay on topic!
You're wasting my valuable time!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:45.410
Old men and their complaining,
makes me want to break some jaws.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.420
You're always so violent.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.880
One day you'll do some real damage
to the Demon Lord's Army

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.500
by hurting this precious brain of mine.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:59.130
Enough. If we leave him be,
our status will be put at risk as well.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.850
The nail that sticks out
must get the hammer!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:07.350
That is the motto of the Demon Lord's
Army Special Executive Benefit Fraternity,

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.730
also known as the Three Ravens!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.690
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:23.450
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:46.280
Episode 6

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:52.120
Mr. Ninomiya, are you
sure you want to do this?

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.670
Huh? Of course. It's an order from above.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:06:00.170
Hunting deserter monsters that have
left the Demon Lord's Army, was it?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:04.550
Doesn't seem like a job
for someone at the Director level...

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.470
Here he comes, here he comes!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:15.690
Now I'll ram in my
"Operation: Forcing into the family"!

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.860
Wow, so tough-looking!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.610
Let's see you deal with them!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.990
They're dumb as insects, but one of
the most powerful monsters out there!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:34.160
From what I can tell,
his muscles aren't built for fighting.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.880
Once those deserters beat him up
a little, I can ride in to the rescue

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:42.210
and establish an
irreversible power structure!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.050
Cry! Scream!

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:49.930
And bow down to your most powerful boss!

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.770
Wow! One hit!

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.980
Ms. Rim is unstoppable as always.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.940
What...

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:02.730
Booyah.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.360
So? Now what?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:10.910
Oh, look, the Big Worm wants to join you.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.710
Hmm. I suppose it can't hurt to have
more manpower. Let's bring them along.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:20.630
Oops, I'm going to get promoted again!
I just can't stop being awesome!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.590
Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.890
I knew it from the start.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:36.520
That childish meat headed "operation"
had no chance of success.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.940
Ugh! Kids these days!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.400
I'm next!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:50.990
I'll make him join the land cultivation
project I've been pushing for!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:54.290
What? We have to turn
this place into a farm?

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:57.250
Those are the orders, yeah.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:02.340
He's stumped! Ugh, kids these days...

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.880
There's no way he can grow crops
in such a barren wasteland.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:09.380
He'll be stuck here getting
nowhere with the cultivation,

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:14.180
and meanwhile, my favorite
subordinates will get undeniable results!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:18.060
He will wither away into
a mere corporate grunt,

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.150
and my position will be safe for eternity!

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.900
What?!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.780
Worm and rough terrain,
what a great combination!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.280
Makes the soil rich!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.660
Such fast plowing!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.160
Now we just need to plant this, right?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.080
Right!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.750
Start with potatoes,
always does the trick.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.920
Don't forget to apply your magic to it
beforehand though, Ranga.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.090
Yeah. Umm...

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.130
Grow, grow, grow, and grow.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.590
Grow bigger.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.850
I knew it, you're so useful, Ranga.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.480
Compared to you, she's...

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:11.740
Oh no! She's trying to eat him!

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:15.330
Ant A! Remember
the shell of that big boss?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.450
Fry it, crush it, and spread it around!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.910
It'll improve the soil!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.210
What incredible efficiency...

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:34.050
This mission was far too difficult for the
violent woman and the obstructive elder.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.060
Know thyself, know thy enemy.
A thousand battles, a thousand victories.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:42.190
You have to do your research first.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.690
Hmm? Hmm?

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:49.860
Wh-Why?! There is no information
about him whatsoever!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:55.070
I see, he knows how to play
the intelligence game. Impressive.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.660
Hmm? This girl...

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:04.830
I see... This is her secret...
This can be put to use.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.850
Oh, so nice!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.810
I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:22.350
Wh-Who are you?!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.230
Apologies for failing to introduce myself.

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:29.690
I am the Assistant Manager
of Finance, Zechs Haller.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:35.450
I've come to ask you a few questions
about your personal data, young lady.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.240
My data...

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.910
Young lady, you...

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.540
You have quite a past.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.540
Have you reported to
your superiors about this?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:54.970
It seems not.
You mustn't overlook the Three R's.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:59.390
One person's mistake could be
a disaster for a whole division.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:01.970
What do you want from me?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.390
Let's see...

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.520
Why don't you just get down and...

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:14.820
No, I'd just like to confirm that you are
willing to apologize, to this camera.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:19.280
Lift your chin up slightly, squeeze
your shoulders, remove your towel,

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.580
and say "I'm sorry"...

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.790
What...

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:31.040
She's a boy?!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.880
So cute, yet...

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.760
No, rather, because he's so cute,

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.890
this is good, beyond good!

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:43.970
He is a new pandora's box,
delivered by the god of sexuality!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:49.440
The passion within me,
it's opening up a new door, I...

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:50.560
Huh?

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.980
Food! Food! Food!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.780
Food for the day is meat!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.910
Unbelievable.
How can all of our plans fail...!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:08.540
Ahem. Mic test one two.
Can you hear me?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.460
General Ninomiya!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:16.800
I've enjoyed your fun presents.
You put in a lot of effort.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:20.680
Thanks to you, my position within
the Demon Lord's Army is secure.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.890
Wh-What?!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:28.390
I knew if I did as I pleased, those
fixated on their position would attack me.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.020
I put that to good use.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:35.730
You all were easier than I expected
though, what a letdown.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:40.450
All right, losers, remember to clean your
chairs, since I'll be sitting in them.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:43.580
Later, losers.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:52.540
Never in my centuries of life as a demon
have I experienced such shame!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.460
I can't believe
he said those things to me!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:13:00.260
We have no other choice but
to throw that impossible mission at him!

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.090
You want to put him in charge of that?!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:07.970
But if by some freak accident he succeeds,
it would truly threaten our positions!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:13.860
Well, as long as we, the Three Ravens,
work together to obstruct him,

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:15.690
there's no way we can fail!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.070
Let's just make sure the
Demon Lord doesn't find out!

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:24.240
General Ninomiya, your days are numbered!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:31.920
And thus, the battle for the
self-interests of the Three Ravens begins!

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:37.920
Go, Three Ravens!
Your battle begins today!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.000
The End

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.230
What is this outfit?

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.350
So cute!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.610
Oh, you're awake, Ranga.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:57.110
Hey, Ninomiya...

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.440
Ew, gross!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.070
Is something wrong?

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.320
Anyway, let's hurry to the queen.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.490
We're running out of time.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.250
The queen? Not the Demon Lord?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:15.750
That's right. The queen is growing
impatient, waiting for us!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.380
Hmm...

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.180
Wow...

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.350
So cute!

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:31.180
They're all hopping!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.270
Hello, Mr. Rabbit. What are you doing?

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.560
What? Work, of course!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:40.650
We have to turn these gears to work
the fountain in the queen's castle!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.610
Wow, that sounds like a lot of work.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:48.910
It sure is! But we can't help it, we're...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.580
...the queen's corporate grunts!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:54.330
Is that something to be so proud of?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.620
Shut up!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.460
We can't go on without
puffing out our chest a little!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.590
We're working day and night with no rest,
so we haven't gone home in forever.

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:03.380
I can't even remember my wife's face!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.970
It's all the queen's fault.

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:06.930
Meaning, it's also your fault!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:07.930
What?!

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:11.220
The fate of corporate
grunt-hood lies here!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.060
Give us overtime pay!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.890
Give us paid time off!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:19.440
I-I'm not the one
who can help you with that...

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:23.490
Hey, wait, what's this?!
I've gotten smaller!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.950
Get him!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:32.700
Ranga! Escape into that hole!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.660
Y-Yeah!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.880
Ouch...

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.880
Welcome! Is this your first visit?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.010
Wow, a mole!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.970
Wh-What is this place?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.520
This place is called an internet cafÃ©,
underneath the kingdom.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:16:03.280
This is a town for losers who don't
want to work for the queen anymore.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:09.240
If you stay too long, it'll drain
your will to do work, so be careful.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:13.410
Let's study the ecology of ants!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.660
Did you know all worker ants are female?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.620
What? You didn't?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:22.210
That's impossible!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.710
Th-This is indeed bad!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.970
Told you. Look around.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:33.680
That's what happens to those
who've settled down here.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:37.930
No work, no goals, just repeating
the same activities every day...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.020
Life is basically over at that point.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:45.110
Hmm... But if the only alternative
is the place where the rabbits were,

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:47.610
isn't working a losing strategy as well?

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.700
Leave to go to hell,
stay and waste away...

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.030
What am I supposed to do?!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.660
Hey!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.910
I-It's the queen!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.620
The queen is here!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.120
Run!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.040
Queen...?

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.550
So huge!

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:13.090
It was taking you too long to come,
so I came to you instead.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:17.770
Oh, we are honored,
Your Highness Queen Belza...

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.890
You're... the queen?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.940
Yes, that's right, Ranga.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:27.730
I, your ancestor Belza, am the queen.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:32.030
Ranga is a descendant
of Queen Belza? Really?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.990
I've wanted to see you, Ranga.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.870
I didn't.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.200
Why not?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.790
You know why!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:45.040
Do you know how much hardship
I went through because of you?!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:49.010
I'm the descendant of the witch
who caused the world to collapse...

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.800
Because of that, my mom and dad...

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:55.390
Died in sorrow, correct?

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:56.600
Huh...?

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.980
Ranga... Do you remember?

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:03.270
How, just because you are my
descendant, you were persecuted,

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:07.110
leaving you with no choice
but to run from your birthplace?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:15.160
How you spent your days in a
lethargic city, hiding your secret?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.040
Of... Of course...

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:25.250
Of course I remember! How could I forget!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.670
It must have been such hard times.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.760
Society is to blame for everything.

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:37.180
You are surrounded by oppression
and stagnation. There is no respite.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:42.230
So you should just let everything go and
spend the rest of your days here, with me.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:45.940
No... No! I can't!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:52.400
Because I already know this is my dream...

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.620
So I have to wake up, even if it's hard!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.620
It's too late for that!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:01.040
You've been running from
everything your entire life.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.370
You've done nothing but run!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.960
But... But...

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:14.590
When will you admit it? The real world
where you live has no need for you!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.180
N-Ninomiya...

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.850
Ranga...

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.730
Let's give up, and just live here...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:33.440
Is...

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:37.490
...something I would never allow!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.950
Ninomiya!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.370
Hey, Belza!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:46.580
What you're doing is exactly
"oppression and stagnation" itself!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.920
Ranga...

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:57.430
Snap out of it already!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:00.390
Ouch! Hey!

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:02.640
What are you doing, Ninomiya?!

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.890
You're finally awake.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.440
You've caused so much trouble.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:09.690
Huh? What have I...

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.650
Is that...?

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.360
Yes, I remember...

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:20.320
We got a job from the Demon Lord,
so we entered the forest,

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.660
then came across that robot...

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:25.910
We fought hard, and it shot
some strange beam at me...

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:31.880
And then I lost consciousness,
and had that dream...

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:37.260
What is this mobile suit-like robot?!

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:40.010
Anyway, we won.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:40.010
Gross.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.510
Now my promotion
to board member is complete.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:47.350
My road is leading steadily towards Japan!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.730
Hey, Ninomiya.

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:51.810
Hmm?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:56.820
I... I've been running away
from things my entire life.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:58.780
Do you think that's wrong?

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:02.070
Huh? Of course, it is.

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:02.070
This part is gross, too!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.870
I... I see...

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:09.920
But of course, there is the
useful phrase, "strategic retreat."

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:10.920
Huh?

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.750
As long as your goal hasn't changed,
you can still be proud,

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:16.050
no matter how many times you run away.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:19.760
You can say, this is a temporary escape,
for the sake of future victory!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:24.600
If anyone wants to argue with you,
just smack them in the head.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:28.310
Even if they're the queen or whatever.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.860
Ninomiya, thanks!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:51.790
We're finally going to see the Demon Lord
face to face. So troublesome!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.000
Excuse us!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:00.800
Welcome, Ninomiya.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.930
So you're the Demon Lord.

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:06.970
Ninomiya, I want to ask you for a favor.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:16.730
Please, save this world.
